---
// Headline is built to Nick's direction and is pending his final wording.
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="sky" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="cloudline" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="page inner">
    <p class="label rise d1">Independent adversarial testing for AI agents</p>

    <h1 class="rise d2">
      We know how AI agents fail.<br />
      <span class="turn">So you can trust the ones you ship.</span>
    </h1>

    <div class="body rise d3">
      <p class="lede">
        We run adversarial attacks against live agents, across security and
        reliability, and turn every finding into an independent, compounding
        dataset of how agents fail.
      </p>
      <p class="counter">
        You have only seen your own agents break. We have seen everyone's.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="actions rise d4">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">Book a scoping call</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#how-agents-fail">See how agents fail</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding-block: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5.5rem) clamp(4.5rem, 10vw, 8rem);
    isolation: isolate;
  }

  /* light source, upper right, the way it falls in the reference */
  .sky {
    position: absolute;
    inset: -30% -10% auto -10%;
    height: 150%;
    z-index: -2;
    background:
      radial-gradient(
        62% 48% at 82% 6%,
        rgba(255, 249, 232, 0.95) 0%,
        rgba(252, 240, 214, 0.6) 34%,
        rgba(246, 241, 232, 0) 68%
      ),
      radial-gradient(
        40% 34% at 88% 0%,
        rgba(231, 183, 96, 0.28) 0%,
        rgba(231, 183, 96, 0) 70%
      ),
      radial-gradient(
        70% 60% at 8% 100%,
        rgba(206, 196, 178, 0.3) 0%,
        rgba(246, 241, 232, 0) 62%
      );
  }

  /* the cloud line. everything above it is above the weather */
  .cloudline {
    position: absolute;
    left: -5%;
    right: -5%;
    bottom: -1px;
    height: 46%;
    z-index: -1;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to top,
      var(--bone) 0%,
      rgba(252, 249, 243, 0.92) 26%,
      rgba(252, 249, 243, 0.5) 55%,
      rgba(252, 249, 243, 0) 100%
    );
  }

  .inner {
    position: relative;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 1.4rem + 4.1vw, 4.2rem);
    margin-block: 1.25rem 0;
    max-width: 20ch;
  }

  /* its own block so the balancer works on this sentence alone,
     otherwise "ship." dangles on a line by itself */
  .turn {
    display: block;
    text-wrap: balance;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }

  .body {
    margin-top: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.1rem;
  }

  .counter {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1rem + 0.35vw, 1.28rem);
    color: var(--gold-text);
    max-width: 46ch;
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--gold);
  }

  .actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
  }
</style>
